title: munir_detour_why_learn
tags: actor:Munir actor:Prince
---
Prince: But, like why?
Munir: I'm glad you asked.
Munir: This knowledge will help you learn what is true.
Munir: What is right and wrong.
Munir: Like a clear scale.

Prince: What do you mean?

Munir: Right now, you don't really know what to do.
Prince: I admit, I ain't got no clue.
Munir: How do you know what is good?
Munir: And what is bad?
Prince: I...
Prince: I don't actually know.
Prince: That's a good point. You're right.

Munir: Without knowledge, you are in the dark.
Munir: In ignorance, you might not even know that you might be doing something wrong.
Munir: Or missing out on things that are good or you are supposed to do.
===